# Moddy Arena: a wished creature is on the players' side here, and a Fighter is one that can hurt. A wished stand-in
# that hunts players (a zombie carrying the core's wish tag, as a stock hunter would) stands beside him in the prep
# room and never hurts him, not even a hit the game says it dealt; far outside the place the same hit lands. In a wave
# a wished polar bear (an attack of 6, and no wish to fight monsters of its own) is a Fighter and its blows land on a
# monster; a wished zombie with no attack at all is not a Fighter. Stand-ins, summoned with the core's wish tag
# (wishmob), as 14-creature-roles uses: the arena reads the same fact for them as for a real wish.
# play-timeout: 900
@intent a wished creature never hurts or hunts a player in the arena and fights the monsters, and only a creature that can hurt is a Fighter, its blows landing at its own attack
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step he arrives
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 900 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy

@step a wished hunter beside him in the prep room never hurts him
summon minecraft:zombie 2.5 64 22.5 {Tags:["wishmob","hunter"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Chomp"}
teleport @s 0.5 64 22.5 90 10
effect give @s minecraft:instant_health 1 5 true
@wait 10s
@shot the-hunter-beside-him
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={Health:20.0f}]
damage @s 4 minecraft:mob_attack by @e[tag=hunter,limit=1]
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @s[nbt={Health:20.0f}]

@step far outside the place, the same hit lands (nothing changes there)
teleport @s 200.5 -60 200.5
@wait 1s
damage @s 4 minecraft:mob_attack by @e[tag=hunter,limit=1]
@wait 5t
@assert execute unless entity @s[nbt={Health:20.0f}]
effect give @s minecraft:instant_health 1 5 true
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=hunter]

@step in a wave: a wished polar bear is a Fighter and its blows land; a wished zombie with no attack is not a Fighter
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 900 4 true
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# the monsters held still where they stand, one of them marked to watch (SHORTCUT: so the test can see one take blows)
execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
tag @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,limit=1,sort=random] add watched
execute at @e[tag=watched] run summon minecraft:polar_bear ~1.5 ~ ~ {Tags:["wishmob","bear"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Snowy"}
execute at @e[tag=watched] run summon minecraft:zombie ~-1.5 ~ ~ {Tags:["wishmob","softie"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Softie"}
attribute @e[tag=softie,limit=1] minecraft:attack_damage base set 0
execute store result score #h0 arenatest run data get entity @e[tag=watched,limit=1] Health 100
@wait 6s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=bear,tag=moddyarena_fighter]
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=softie,tag=moddyarena_fighter]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=softie,tag=moddyarena_role]
# 0 when the watched monster is gone (beaten): the store then never happens
scoreboard players set #h1 arenatest 0
execute store result score #h1 arenatest run data get entity @e[tag=watched,limit=1] Health 100
scoreboard players get #h0 arenatest
scoreboard players get #h1 arenatest
@shot the-bear-fights
@expect chat /Snowy is a Fighter/ within 5s
@expect chat /Softie is a (Healer|Tank)/ within 5s
@assert execute unless score #h1 arenatest >= #h0 arenatest
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
